1491
01:08:20.200 --> 01:08:20.460
Yeah.

1492
01:08:20.500 --> 01:08:23.140
That he is Creed Breton, a member of Grassroots.

1493
01:08:23.380 --> 01:08:23.540
Yeah.

1494
01:08:23.740 --> 01:08:26.100
