1536
01:10:25.660 --> 01:10:25.940
Yeah.

1537
01:10:33.080 --> 01:10:33.300
You know?

1538
01:10:33.500 --> 01:10:33.740
Yeah.

1539
01:10:33.900 --> 01:10:34.240
Yes.

1540
01:10:34.300 --> 01:10:34.980
It's heartbreaking.

