1593
01:12:45.280 --> 01:12:47.840
Let's put Angela through hell this year.

1594
01:12:48.500 --> 01:12:51.140
And let her soften just a smidge.

1595
01:12:51.280 --> 01:12:52.780
Let her deserve a happy ending.

1596
01:12:53.100 --> 01:12:53.320
Yeah.

1597
01:12:54.520 --> 01:12:59.640
So then we have a scene where we see that Captain Jack and Meredith are sneaking away

1598
01:13:01.560 --> 01:13:04.120
to make out, get it on, something.

1599
01:13:04.360 --> 01:13:08.340
Meredith's going to come back later without a shirt on and just a life preserver.

