Yeah.

1603
01:13:11.580 --> 01:13:13.900
That said, dear Kate, stop taking your clothes off.

1604
01:13:14.060 --> 01:13:14.620
Thanks, dad.

1605
01:13:15.140 --> 01:13:15.620
Yes.

1606
01:13:16.500 --> 01:13:21.360
Well, this gives Michael the opening to take the microphone and really start his presentation,

1607
01:13:21.980 --> 01:13:25.120
which he does by announcing that the ship is sinking.

1608
01:13:25.380 --> 01:13:25.720
Mm-hmm.

1609
01:13:26.540 --> 01:13:31.660
Most of the people don't realize that this is a metaphor, passengers panic, and a man jumps

1610
01:13:31.660 --> 01:13:32.200
overboard.

1611
